00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.040
Chapter 6 Warrior

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.640
Okay, okay, that's it.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.570
Hey, hey, hey, are we
calling it quits already?

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:17.830
Hey, man, what'd be the point
in injuring even more people?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.080
Mr. Nagakura, let's stop already!

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.290
No one can win against
Mr. Harada using spears anyway!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.250
Sure, you say that, but on the
program the Commander came up with,

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:32.750
it says, "Spear-fighting Tournament."

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.170
Well, well, well.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.750
That's our Sanosuke!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:40.120
Brilliant Taneda Style
Spear-fighting technique, as ever!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.180
Come on now, what's the matter?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.930
Isn't there anyone else
up to challenging Sanosuke?

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:48.390
Mr. Kondo...

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.540
I guess it can't be helped.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.580
Let's see... What comes after this again?

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.330
A footrace around Mibu Village and...

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.200
Ah, we have an eating contest too.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.490
So, Mr. Kondo...

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:06.790
All right, I guess we'll say that
Sanosuke won the spear-fighting.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.080
And now...

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.200
Mr. Kondo!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.500
What is it, Sannan?

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:17.250
And here I was, wondering what you meant
by taking advantage of Hijikata's absence,

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.380
while he's away on an errand
to Osaka for Lord Matsudaira...

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:25.300
So what's wrong with that?
As they say, while the demon's away...

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.540
Besides, there's a certain
tendency for us to be feared.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.950
It's good to invite the neighboring
people in once in a while

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:42.790
and cultivate some good will.
Oh, please. What good will?

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:46.450
This place is virtually deserted.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.330
That is not entirely true.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.290
Oh, Saito.

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:54.080
There are many here.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.380
Ghosts still lingering,
unable to let go of this world.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.550
Well, being in bloody
conflicts all the time...

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.200
We need a little breather
every so often, don't you think?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.030
Besides...

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:16.320
There's also the matter of our puppy,
who's been rather cheerless lately.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.370
Sheesh.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:25.290
Why does the Shinsengumi have
to do this kind of festival crap?

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.700
Yo, what's up, puppy boy?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.250
You look awfully long in the face!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:33.910
Not really.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.790
You could've joined in the
spear-fighting tournament too, you know.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.120
It doesn't matter if you're
a full member or a page.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:42.450
The Commander's sanctioned
setting all formalities aside.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.790
And the demon
Vice Commander isn't here either.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:49.260
It's a golden opportunity for you to show off
what you're capable of to everyone else, right?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:56.620
Of course, that's <i>if </i>you've actually
got skills worth showing off.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.960
You've got a point there!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.980
Maybe so.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.610
This isn't right.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.120
Yeah, normally, he'd...

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.410
Bastard!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.540
If that's what you really think,
I'll <i>show </i>you my skills!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.830
It's definitely odd.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.510
Heisuke, you think so too?

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.450
It's odd no matter how you look at it.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.910
Only the person who wins the footrace

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:31.180
gets to have Ayu's special
large serving of <i>okowa </i>rice.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:36.000
Getting to have Ayu's <i>okowa </i>rice
all to yourself is definitely odd...

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.410
Hey, that's not it!

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.620
Ayu's...

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.070
special <i>okowa </i>rice!

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.410
Sanosuke, not you too.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.840
You look bored.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:05.760
Not really.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.230
Must be my imagination then.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.060
What about you?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.830
You're always running around
on errands for Mr. Hijikata,

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.070
so wouldn't the footrace
be an easy win for you?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:30.030
Or is it that you can't run
unless you're cross-dressing?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:35.500
What? You wanna fight?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:39.420
Sorry, I don't have time
to play with a sulky child.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.840
What the hell about me
are you calling sulky?!

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.120
Hey!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.830
Mibu Temple

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.090
<i>Tetsu...</i>

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.830
<i>That's it. You're fine the way you are.</i>

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.250
<i>You're still you, even
if you're being sulky.</i>

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.160
<i>There's no need to push yourself to
become a full member of the Shinsengumi.</i>

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.580
<i>If it ever gets tough, just come
and leap into my arms...</i>

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.410
So this is where you were, Tatsunosuke.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.170
Oh, Mr. Yamanami.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:27.620
When you're a bookkeeper, you tend
not to get enough exercise, right?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.410
How about we go run with everyone?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.660
No, that is, I...

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.790
It may be a silly idea of Mr. Kondo's,

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:41.080
but I think participating in the martial
arts competition might be entertaining.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:45.080
More importantly, that is...
My younger brother...

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.150
Are you not coming?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.580
Yes, sir. Gladly.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.160
Shall we go, then?

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.660
Oh, it's you, Saizo.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.260
Aren't you going to go watch?

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:16.790
Well, not that it's all
that interesting to watch.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.440
If you could become strong just by
participating in a competition like that,

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.950
no one would have any trouble.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.270
You think so, too, don't you, Saizo?

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.700
What're you getting mad at me for?!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.700
Everyone, just do your best!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.450
The special <i>okowa </i>rice will be mine!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.870
You can say that <i>after </i>you've won!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.710
You gonna be able to keep up with me?!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.750
Don't mess with me, Sano!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.210
When it comes to Ayu's special <i>okowa </i>rice,

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:52.790
it's a masterpiece even Kyoto's long-established
restaurants know they can't compete with!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:56.160
For the chance to eat your
fill of that, well...

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.450
Oh, I can't believe you guys.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.080
Sure, I'd love to have Ayu's <i>okowa </i>rice,

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.540
but you don't have to get
so worked up over it.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.160
What?!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.490
I'm just gonna take it easy.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.020
That's what all of you are
going to do too, right?

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:14.540
If that's what you think, Mr.
Nagakura, well...

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.000
Yeah, I agree.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:17.950
Mr. Yamanami?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.330
After all, today is just supposed
to be an entertaining break.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.750
There's no need to strain ourselves.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.910
That's certainly true, but...

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:29.290
That kind of takes the
competitive fun out of it.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.750
And now!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.800
Everyone, get set!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.040
Let the race begin!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.370
You're in my way! You're in my way!

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.700
Come on, come on! Move
it, move it, move it!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.160
You guys, move out of the way!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.540
Shinpachi! And Mr. Yamanami too?!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.540
They're pouring it on
right out of the gate!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:06.910
As Sun Tzu said, "The war is won,
before the battle has even begun!"

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.330
You guys were stupid for
taking what we said seriously!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.870
Hey! That's dirty!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.510
Oh, dear, so this is where you were.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:23.870
So you ended up not
participating in the footrace either.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.430
Mr. Kondo was worried, you know.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.190
Same to you, too...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:33.830
Same to you, too.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:38.200
I get scolded by Mr. Hijikata
if I run footraces and stuff.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.540
You look bored.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.660
I'm not, really.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.580
Don't lose to Mr. Nagakura!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.750
Run like our lives depend on it!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.110
It looks like everyone's
having a lot of fun.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.120
Since we're having this festival of sorts,

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:02.460
I thought I'd also invite
the neighborhood children.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.840
Well, I'll go now.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:12.060
What about having our own
kind of festival here ourselves?

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.610
Please!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.120
You really are an interesting one.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:26.620
You're about the only one who
would ask me to spar with you here.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.660
All right... I'll be your partner.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.980
There they are! Shinpachi and Mr. Yamanami!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.400
Shinpachi! Wait, you!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.700
What idiot waits for people in a footrace?!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.490
Exactly!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.450
Then I'll just have to catch up to you!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.450
Ayu's...

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.570
special <i>okowa </i>rice!

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.050
So long, Vice Commander Yamanami!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.760
That leaves...
just Shinpachi!

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.290
This is one race I can't afford to lose!

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.650
Are you just going to keep
running away, Mr. Okita?!

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.950
Put on some protectors, Tetsu.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.290
This is different from bamboo swords.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.790
You will not come out unscathed.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.630
Are you all right?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.430
If you don't come at me
seriously, you'll regret it!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.410
Please tell me.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:39.450
Why did you take up the sword?

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:42.630
What did you become strong for?

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:58.660
I want to become strong to
avenge my mother and father!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:03.330
But no matter what reasons
I have, I can't...

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.360
I can't kill!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:20.170
My answer will not be your answer.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:25.450
I can do nothing.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:27.840
But you know...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:33.410
I won't insist on continuing this
until you can win against me.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:36.770
However, I will keep you
company until you are satisfied.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.170
Mr. Okita...

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.160
I...

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:42.690
What is it?

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:52.040
Getting some exercise for once
was refreshing somehow!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.950
I'd better get back to the temple
after I take a little break.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.410
There's the melee competition
in the afternoon too,

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:02.160
so I'll be real busy as a page.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.710
Thank you for your hard work.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:11.720
Mr. Okita...

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.320
Thank you.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.440
Say, Tetsu...

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.680
The reason for which one
takes up the sword...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:28.040
The reason for which one becomes strong...

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:31.400
Differs from one person
to another, I'm sure.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:39.960
To another person, it might be
a silly thing or a terrible thing,

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:45.200
but take your time, and really,
really agonize over it a lot.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.410
Otherwise...

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:52.510
Honestly! And here I was talking seriously.

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:56.860
You're alike even in these respects.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.880
What reason, is it?

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:09.290
If I said, I'd probably get
laughed at, wouldn't I, Mr. Hijikata?

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.250
I'm not gonna lose!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.720
That's my line!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.870
Ten more <i>ken</i>!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.330
You guys, watch out.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:32.800
Pardon me, coming through!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.580
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.350
First place, Keisuke Yamanami!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.650
Well, that was a pretty good race.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.330
Wait, with abaci?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.870
Is that even allowed?

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:08.540
No matter how you look
at it, that's foul play!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.700
Whoa! Whoa! Calm down, Shinpachi!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.920
That was dirty! Commit seppuku!
Slit your stomach, damn it!

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.860
Mr. Yamanami...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:27.900
Well, well, that's Ayumu's
special <i>okowa </i>rice, all right!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.660
Lucky Mr. Yamanami, he
gets it all to himself.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.910
I want some too.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.320
I won't acknowledge it!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:38.280
I'll never acknowledge foul play like that!

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:43.450
Now, now, there's no point in crying
over what's past already, Nagakura.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.790
I don't want to hear that from you!
Everyone!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.200
It's not special <i>okowa </i>rice,

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.080
but here's some specially
made rice balls for lunch.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.800
You all eat your fill and do
your best in the afternoon, too!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.390
Shoot, I overslept.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:16.750
Forty bamboo swords
and twenty red headbands...

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.200
Melee competition?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.830
Is that fun?

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.480
Could I do it too?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.120
I don't think that's quite possible.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.830
Mr. Okita...

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:31.250
Oh, are you getting things ready?
Good work.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.420
Those kids...

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.040
I got them to come over, just like I said.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.540
Are you a member of the Shinsengumi too?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:42.080
But you're even shorter
than my big brother.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:45.470
Don't be silly! I might
be short, but I'm good!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.750
For real?

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:53.910
Then, you'll be in the melee
competition this afternoon, right?

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.230
There's nothing wrong with that, right?

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:01.870
Yeah.
And you also have a visitor.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.120
For me?
Yes.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.010
Saya!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.040
She was wandering to and fro
in front of headquarters,

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.080
looking awkward about coming in.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.500
Since she was there anyway,
I brought her with me.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.350
Saya...

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.720
About the other day...

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:23.580
I'm sorry.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:33.360
I said some weird stuff all of
a sudden and made you mad.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.010
"I...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:42.490
am...

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.120
sor...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.150
ry..."

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.870
No, like I said, it was my
fault and you aren't...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.630
Tetsu...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.330
If neither of you were really at fault,

00:19:56.330 --> 00:20:02.380
well then, you can just become
friends all over again, right?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.390
He's right, Saya. Let's be friends.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:13.620
Whoa, you suddenly bringing your
girlfriend over now, puppy boy?

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.080
Sizzling!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.860
If she's here, you better show off!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.350
You're gonna be in the
melee competition, right?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.030
Of course I am!

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.750
All right!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.750
That's the spirit, right?

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:31.370
They say your fighting skills brought
a grunt of approval from Mr. Kondo.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:34.360
I'm looking forward to it, puppy boy.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:34.870
Later.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.580
Saya, I'll promise you.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:40.910
Just the way I am...

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.880
I'll become stronger just the way I am now!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:50.410
I might still be troubled
and agonize over things,

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.120
but I promise.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.850
No matter what, I won't do
anything that'll make you sad, Saya.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:04.370
Say, Sannan.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.790
What is it?

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.160
I've decided after all.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.790
I'm sure Toshi will be against it,

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.830
but I intend to give him a
uniform and his own sword.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.880
You mean Tetsunosuke Ichimura.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.370
He should be capable of
choosing on his own now.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:23.660
That's what I think.

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:25.960
Now, then...

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.160
It looks like everyone's done eating,

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.890
so let's move on to the melee competition.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:41.500
We'll now split into East and West Armies
and conduct the melee competition!

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:55.660
Mibu Temple

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:45.200
East Army, West Army, are you ready?!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.750
Yeah!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.810
Then, begin!

